# Public source preservation: never commit runtime credentials/data.
**/node_modules/
**/.env
**/.env.*
**/.openai/local/
**/.openai/hosting.json
**/.wrangler/
**/*.sqlite
**/*.sqlite3
**/*.db
**/*.pem
**/*.key

